├─ Validate farmer inputs                            00:04 complete

│  ├─ Check farm and field IDs                       0.2 s

│  ├─ Validate field coordinates                     0.1 s

│  └─ Check crop history and required fields         0.4 s

├─ Retrieve external evidence                        00:04–00:11

│  ├─ Open-Meteo current/forecast                     2.1 s  success

│  ├─ NASA POWER daily climate                       3.0 s  success

│  └─ Soil dataset                                   skipped — connector not active

├─ Prepare climate and water inputs                  00:11–00:13

